    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Premium Viewing Experience</strong></h2>Enjoy movie theater quality with stunning 4K Ultra HD video playback.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Enhanced Blu-ray &amp; DVD Playback</strong></h2>Enjoy a cinema-like experience from the comfort of your home.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1914130/extras/4bc560eb4bbb3927001611fc45308c36.avif?t=1754573749\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Most Comprehensive Media Playback Solution</strong></h2>Now featuring a completely redesigned user interface and new AI tools.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1914130/extras/3a4cb0565bca43786eaf44a07b8667bf.avif?t=1754573749\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>All Major Formats Supported</strong></h2>Watch your favorite content in virtually any format.<br>* Pro version does not support HEVC / H.265.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1914130/extras/5b8cb839ad49430be6907d12260566b0.avif?t=1754573749\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PowerDVD, Reimagined</strong></h2>Discover our completely redesigned user interface with a more user-friendly media management hub.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1914130/extras/3e511e21997cd9aaa06327f15a40439b.avif?t=1754573749\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Your Movies, Your Way</strong></h2>Organize your media with customizable thumbnails, poster walls, and AI-powered photo management.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1914130/extras/01aa6e831be03e979c283d066cec1acd.avif?t=1754573749\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Breathe New Life into Your Favorite Movies and Videos</strong></h2>Turn your living room into a home theater with our patented TrueTheater technology.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>TrueTheater</strong></h2>Watch your movies like never before with deeper colors and enhanced video/audio playback.<br>*Pro does not support TrueTheater HDR.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1914130/extras/63f46b9699b01d079719e0ffae35426a.avif?t=1754573749\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Studio-Quality Audio</strong></h2>Get the most out of your home theater system with DTS-HD, Dolby Audio, and Hi-Res 7.1 surround sound.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1914130/extras/b1e093982480f991b49ff1c8fc39e04e.avif?t=1754573749\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Your Personal Digital Media Hub</strong></h2>PowerDVD is the most robust and versatile solution for all your entertainment needs.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Experience YouTube Without Any Interruptions</strong></h2>Watch your favorite YouTube videos offline without interruptions.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1914130/extras/07a488c24e1bf3c4606b6f70a326a988.avif?t=1754573749\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Cast to TV or Streaming Devices</strong></h2>Play your media on the big screen or your favorite devices in the best available quality.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1914130/extras/c20c56606f1bd9d1c53fe57fd0500f96.avif?t=1754573749\" /></div>",
